1
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,160
Chen Yanzhou.

2
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,280
Actually,

3
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,840
there's something I've been wanting
to ask you these past few days.

4
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,240
You…

5
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,200
Another dream?

6
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,240
I really miss you.

7
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,680
ZHENG YU

8
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:54,480
<i>Sorry about last night.</i>

9
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:12,160
TO-DO LIST: HERBURG BUSINESS TRIP

10
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,520
To avoid being disturbed.

11
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,040
CHEN YANZHOU

12
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:14,360
<i>I'm leaving today</i>
<i>for a two-day business trip to Herburg.</i>

13
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:15,720
<i>I'll see you when I get back.</i>

14
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,840
ZHENG YU

15
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,840
<i>Okay.</i>

16
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,400
BERLIN INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS'
SECOND-HAND MARKET

17
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:31,120
<i>Is anyone near TU Berlin</i>
<i>selling a doorstop?</i>

18
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:59,000
<i>Chen Yanzhou, when will you be back?</i>

19
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:04,920
<i>I'm leaving Herburg tomorrow at three.</i>
<i>Should be back in Berlin around five.</i>

20
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:12,360
<i>What's wrong? Did something happen?</i>

21
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,840
<i>I'll wait for you to get back.</i>

22
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:25,560
<i>There are a few things</i>
<i>I want to clear up in person.</i>

23
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,640
<i>All right.</i>

24
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:42,640
That's all for today's class.

25
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:46,320
I hope all of you
have a great rest of your day!

26
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,600
Did you hear?

27
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,480
There was a shooting!

28
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,760
When did it happen?

29
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,320
About an hour ago, I think.

30
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:00,320
Did they catch the shooter?

31
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:04,080
If they haven't, I'm definitely
not going to Herburg this weekend.

32
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,240
- Hello.
<i>- Zheng Yu.</i>

33
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,560
Chen Yanzhou.

34
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:38,160
I saw the news about
the shooting at Herburg Station.

35
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,440
I saw it too.

36
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,560
I'm safe.

37
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,960
<i>I'm already in Berlin.</i>

38
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:44,960
I missed your call earlier.
The signal was probably bad.

39
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:51,640
Hello?

40
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:58,680
I want to see you.

41
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:04,760
I want to see you too.
Where are you?

42
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,840
I'll come to you.

43
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:09,160
I'm waiting for the subway,
about to head to the train station.

44
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:10,920
The train station?

45
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:15,120
Were you coming to find me?

46
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,920
<i>Were you worried about me?</i>

47
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,520
I just wanted to see you sooner.

48
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,560
I'm still on the bus
heading back to the institute.

49
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:30,040
Let's meet up at a station halfway.

50
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,800
<i>Get off after three stops.</i>

51
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:33,720
<i>At that station, transfer to another line.</i>

52
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,440
<i>Then get off after four more stops.</i>

53
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,840
<i>We'll meet in front of the cathedral.</i>

54
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:54,880
Good luck.

55
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,080
Are we

56
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,160
completely crazy?

57
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,040
Maybe.

58
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,600
- I have something to tell you.
- Me too.

59
00:15:35,680 --> 00:15:36,560
Let me go first.

60
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,080
Chen Yanzhou.

61
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:44,960
Actually,

62
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,800
I've had feelings for you for a long time.

63
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:55,320
Maybe it was that day at the campsite,

64
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:58,400
<i>when I realized</i>
<i>you'd given me your jacket.</i>

65
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:04,040
<i>Maybe it was when you fought for me,</i>
<i>and I saw your wounds.</i>

66
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:09,880
<i>Or maybe it was when I confronted you</i>

67
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:13,240
<i>and saw the way you looked at me,</i>
<i>so resolute.</i>

68
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:16,560
I kept asking myself
whether I should love,

69
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:20,920
whether I should let someone
become part of my entire life…

70
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:27,280
even if my emotions
were constantly affected by him,

71
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:30,160
even if part of who I am

72
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,680
might change because of him.

73
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:35,440
I backed away so many times,

74
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:38,960
but you always bravely came toward me.

75
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:44,240
Slowly, I realized
that in every moment of hesitation,

76
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:46,960
my hesitation itself was the answer.

77
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,200
Chen Yanzhou.

78
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:55,960
I like you.

79
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,800
But

80
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:06,480
there are some things
I need to make clear first.

81
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:10,440
I'm the kind of person
who overcomplicates things.

82
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:11,880
I know.

83
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:14,040
And I tend to say
the opposite of what I mean.

84
00:17:14,119 --> 00:17:16,079
What's on my mind is one thing,

85
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:19,000
but what comes out of my mouth
is something else entirely.

86
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:21,160
But you expressed yourself
so well just now.

87
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,560
I…

88
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,960
I'm also very conflicted.

89
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:27,880
I want to get closer to you,
but I'm afraid of getting hurt.

90
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:30,440
But you're being so brave now.

91
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:37,040
I might end up exhausting you,
making you guess what I'm thinking.

92
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:39,680
Conveniently enough,
I have a lot of patience.

93
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:43,040
I'm not good at sweet-talk either.

94
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:46,640
Once we've been together a while,
you might find me really boring.

95
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,720
Is that so?

96
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:51,200
Then why do I feel like
ever since I met you,

97
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:52,440
I've been smiling all the time?

98
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:03,200
Do you have any other questions?

99
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,200
Just one more.

100
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:08,160
Didn't you say earlier
that you had something to tell me?

101
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,760
What was it?

102
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:12,200
- I forgot.
- You…

103
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,400
I remember now.

104
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:17,920
You said that

105
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,360
some things should wait until we're sober.

106
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,840
I'm completely sober right now.

107
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:19,280
I'm here.

108
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:28,800
I'll head upstairs now.

109
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,240
Well,

110
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:33,200
see you tomorrow then.

111
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:37,320
I have classes all day tomorrow.

112
00:19:39,280 --> 00:19:40,320
What time do they end?

113
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,400
Three o'clock.

114
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,880
Then I'll pick you up at 3.01 p.m.

115
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:50,520
So you're only giving me one minute
to run back to my dorm?

116
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:56,080
So what are you planning to do?

117
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:04,880
Hold your hand for day two.

118
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,200
Then I'll try

119
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:10,520
to run faster.

120
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:12,280
Okay.

121
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,960
Go on upstairs.

122
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:16,960
Good night.

123
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:19,440
Good night.

124
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,160
TIMER

125
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,200
<i>It's been an hour.</i>

126
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:10,360
<i>Are you home yet?</i>

127
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:13,560
<i>Just got back.</i>

128
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:14,680
<i>Opening the door.</i>

129
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,240
<i>I'm inside.</i>

130
00:21:19,280 --> 00:21:20,360
<i>Turning on the lights.</i>

131
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,000
<i>Taking off my shoes.</i>

132
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,960
<i>Sitting down on the sofa.</i>

133
00:21:26,280 --> 00:21:27,480
<i>What are you doing?</i>

134
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:31,280
<i>Reporting to my girlfriend!</i>

135
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:52,960
<i>You have an early class tomorrow.</i>
<i>Why are you still awake?</i>

136
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:55,560
<i>I can't sleep.</i>

137
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,560
<i>Don't tell me you have insomnia.</i>

138
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:07,400
<i>Of course not.</i>
<i>I'm going to sleep now.</i>

139
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:09,400
<i>Good night.</i>

140
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:19,040
Good night.

141
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:24,440
<i>Good night.</i>

142
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:29,840
<i>Good night.</i>

143
00:22:34,200 --> 00:22:35,120
<i>Good night.</i>

144
00:22:43,840 --> 00:22:44,920
<i>Good night.</i>

145
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:20,800
Could he already be here?

146
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:21,960
I shouldn't be late, right?

147
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:25,360
What are you doing here?

148
00:23:26,520 --> 00:23:28,840
I couldn't really
make you run back in one minute.

149
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:34,800
Let's exchange.

150
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:40,120
I didn't prepare a gift.

151
00:23:44,440 --> 00:23:45,720
I meant this.

152
00:23:56,120 --> 00:23:57,600
Didn't you sleep well last night?

153
00:23:57,680 --> 00:23:58,760
It's not that.

154
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:03,280
My next-door roommate is just too noisy.

155
00:24:03,360 --> 00:24:06,000
She keeps bringing friends over
to throw parties.

156
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:06,920
Parties?

157
00:24:07,800 --> 00:24:10,040
Then why don't you find another place?

158
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,000
It's fine.

159
00:24:11,080 --> 00:24:13,440
I'll find some time
to have a proper talk with her.

160
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:15,320
Or…

161
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:16,720
would you like me to help?

162
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:21,000
It's okay. I can handle it myself.

163
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:25,200
If anything happens, you have to call me.

164
00:24:25,280 --> 00:24:26,680
No matter how small it is.

165
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:28,840
Got it.

166
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:32,240
What do you want to eat today?

167
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,960
Chinese food.

168
00:24:34,040 --> 00:24:37,280
I've been here for so many days,
and I'm really craving Chinese food.

169
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:44,600
I know a chef who's an amazing cook.

170
00:24:46,600 --> 00:24:49,760
So the chef you're talking about
is actually you?

171
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:54,120
Why? Scared it won't taste good?

172
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:55,760
No.

173
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,600
I've spent the past year
practicing really hard.

174
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:01,600
Then I'm looking forward to it.

175
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:07,120
Is there anything I can help with?

176
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,040
No need.

177
00:25:08,120 --> 00:25:10,160
You're my guest today.
All you have to do is wait.

178
00:25:10,800 --> 00:25:12,120
Just sit on the sofa.

179
00:26:12,120 --> 00:26:13,320
I wasn't lying, was I?

180
00:26:14,080 --> 00:26:15,600
I underestimated you.

181
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:18,880
By the way,

182
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:21,440
make me a list of all your favorite foods.

183
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:26,640
Otherwise, how are you going
to order food every day?

184
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:31,040
You're just trying to trick me
into eating at your place every day.

185
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:35,720
Then would you be willing
to come over for dinner every day?

186
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:41,760
Never mind. My place is too far.

187
00:26:42,280 --> 00:26:44,800
How about I deliver meals
to you every day?

188
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:47,640
Then how much is the delivery fee?

189
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:50,720
Aside from money,

190
00:26:50,800 --> 00:26:53,040
you can pay however you see fit.

191
00:26:57,560 --> 00:26:58,960
Eat up.

192
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:02,960
Try this.

193
00:27:03,040 --> 00:27:04,760
It's Chef Xiaozhou's signature dish.

194
00:27:07,760 --> 00:27:09,480
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

195
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:25,800
Do you like this flower?

196
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,600
Then wrap this one up and take it back.

197
00:27:29,120 --> 00:27:30,480
I don't have a vase in my room.

198
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:34,440
You were just spacing out,
thinking about this?

199
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:37,120
No.

200
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:39,120
I was thinking…

201
00:27:41,840 --> 00:27:43,000
Chen Yanzhou,

202
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:45,360
you seem really good at dating.

203
00:27:49,040 --> 00:27:52,320
When holding hands,
you know the perfect timing.

204
00:27:52,400 --> 00:27:54,720
When going on dates, you pick great spots.

205
00:27:54,800 --> 00:27:58,320
You're good at expressing yourself,
and you know how to be romantic.

206
00:27:59,160 --> 00:28:01,840
You must have a lot of experience.

207
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:09,000
What if I told you

208
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:11,440
this was my first time?

209
00:28:11,520 --> 00:28:12,640
Would you believe me?

210
00:28:14,840 --> 00:28:15,960
Not really.

211
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,320
Then what if I told you

212
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:21,240
I learned it all from movies?

213
00:28:21,320 --> 00:28:22,520
Would you believe me?

214
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:26,240
- Movies?
- That's right.

215
00:28:26,320 --> 00:28:28,040
Don't all those old movies
do things this way?

216
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:30,960
I just happen to be a good student.

217
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:35,840
Well, I probably wouldn't get
a very high score

218
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,920
in that department.

219
00:28:42,520 --> 00:28:43,600
Zheng Yu.

220
00:28:46,360 --> 00:28:48,560
Let me share a secret with you
on how to get a high score.

221
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,040
What is it?

222
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:54,680
Laugh whenever you feel like laughing.

223
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:56,080
Say whatever you feel like saying.

224
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:58,480
Rub your hands if you're nervous.

225
00:28:58,560 --> 00:29:00,560
Tell me what you want to eat
when you're hungry.

226
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,800
Come find me when you're bored.

227
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:05,920
If you want to ask if I have experience,
just ask directly.

228
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:09,880
Isn't that exactly
what I'm doing right now?

229
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:11,640
Exactly. So you see?

230
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:13,800
Aren't you already doing an amazing job?

231
00:29:15,960 --> 00:29:17,080
Nonsense.

232
00:29:19,120 --> 00:29:20,840
No. It's the truth.

233
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:23,760
Just be yourself.

234
00:29:23,840 --> 00:29:27,680
I'll learn everything else
and take care of it.

235
00:29:29,040 --> 00:29:31,520
Then I'll do my best to learn too.

236
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:50,640
Ms. Zheng's learning ability
is impressive indeed.

237
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:53,560
Looks like I'll have
to take back what I said.

238
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,240
Some things

239
00:29:55,320 --> 00:29:57,440
really do require learning together.

240
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:59,360
Haven't we washed the dishes?

241
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,920
I… I'll wash them.

242
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:04,160
Didn't you say we should keep learning?

243
00:30:04,240 --> 00:30:06,960
- Ms. Zheng, you need to study hard!
- I didn't say that!

244
00:30:07,040 --> 00:30:08,800
Come on. Let me wash them.

245
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:12,920
- Don't move. I'll do it.
- This is not the kind of learning I meant.

246
00:30:27,040 --> 00:30:28,440
<i>Are you in the classroom yet?</i>

247
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:30,120
CHEN YANZHOU

248
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,040
<i>Yes.</i>

249
00:30:31,760 --> 00:30:33,320
<i>I hope the lecturer for this class</i>

250
00:30:33,400 --> 00:30:36,440
<i>won't randomly blurt out German phrases</i>
<i>in the middle of lecturing in English.</i>

251
00:30:36,520 --> 00:30:39,800
ZHENG YU

252
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:12,200
<i>The lecturer in my last class today</i>
<i>wore two different socks.</i>

253
00:31:12,280 --> 00:31:14,040
<i>One black, one brown.</i>

254
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:15,960
<i>I had such a hard time</i>
<i>holding back my laughter.</i>

255
00:31:16,040 --> 00:31:19,320
<i>Do you think he did it on purpose</i>
<i>or by accident?</i>

256
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:27,240
REALLY WANT TO GO BACK TO BERLIN EARLY

257
00:33:25,560 --> 00:33:26,960
<i>I've received it.</i>

258
00:33:27,040 --> 00:33:28,960
CHEN YANZHOU

259
00:33:29,040 --> 00:33:30,840
<i>You just received it today?</i>

260
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:33,080
<i>The German postal service</i>
<i>really breaks your heart.</i>

261
00:33:33,800 --> 00:33:35,440
<i>Are you done with your experiment?</i>

262
00:33:36,280 --> 00:33:38,280
<i>Not yet. Just taking a three-minute break.</i>

263
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:42,520
<i>Sounds so exhausting.</i>

264
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:44,480
<i>Next time, I'll go visit you instead.</i>

265
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,760
<i>When is the next time?</i>

266
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:55,560
<i>Tomorrow.</i>

267
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:57,440
<i>It's the weekend, and I'm free.</i>

268
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:02,680
<i>I've read this message three times.</i>

269
00:34:07,360 --> 00:34:08,600
<i>And?</i>

270
00:34:11,040 --> 00:34:14,320
<i>I felt like getting scolded by my advisor</i>
<i>today didn't even matter anymore.</i>

271
00:34:16,639 --> 00:34:18,719
<i>Get some rest early. See you tomorrow.</i>

272
00:34:20,639 --> 00:34:21,800
<i>See you tomorrow.</i>

273
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:16,840
ZHENG YU: SEE YOU TOMORROW.

274
00:36:05,040 --> 00:36:06,000
Hello.

275
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:07,040
Chen Yanzhou…

276
00:36:08,160 --> 00:36:09,960
Don't panic. I'm on my way.

277
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:12,960
Wait for me.

278
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:27,400
CHEN YANZHOU

279
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:37,760
Chen Yanzhou!

280
00:37:46,360 --> 00:37:47,200
Sorry I'm late.

281
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:49,120
Were they chasing you?

282
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,240
They didn't catch up.

283
00:38:07,200 --> 00:38:08,320
How did you get out?

284
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:11,680
I used a lighter
and triggered the fire alarm.

285
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:15,040
Our dorm has an interconnected
wireless alarm system.

286
00:38:15,120 --> 00:38:17,720
When one alarm goes off,
all the others go off too.

287
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:21,000
They seem like heavy smokers,
so I just used it to my advantage.

288
00:38:22,600 --> 00:38:25,720
They'll have to pay the fee
for the fire department dispatch, though.

289
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:29,480
But at least I helped eliminate
a safety hazard in the dorm.

290
00:38:30,600 --> 00:38:33,040
They were actually going
to chase after me,

291
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,880
but they picked the wrong person.

292
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:36,960
I used to get chased
by Wu Fa's gang every single day.

293
00:38:37,040 --> 00:38:38,280
I run way faster than them.

294
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,560
Let's go home.

295
00:39:12,360 --> 00:39:13,840
The car is parked pretty far away.

296
00:39:13,920 --> 00:39:15,920
Those shoes won't
be comfortable to walk in.

297
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:42,160
You can stay here comfortably.

298
00:39:42,240 --> 00:39:43,560
I'll stay at a colleague's place.

299
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:45,880
It's fine.

300
00:39:46,920 --> 00:39:48,640
I can sleep on the sofa.

301
00:39:50,200 --> 00:39:52,000
You can get a good night's sleep in a bed.

302
00:39:52,080 --> 00:39:53,200
Why sleep on a sofa?

303
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:56,520
Don't worry about imposing on me.
I'm happy to do it.

304
00:39:56,600 --> 00:39:59,120
My colleague's apartment
is very close to the research institute,

305
00:39:59,200 --> 00:40:01,080
so it's actually much
more convenient for me.

306
00:40:01,160 --> 00:40:02,240
But you…

307
00:40:03,040 --> 00:40:04,880
You'll have a longer commute
to school now,

308
00:40:04,960 --> 00:40:06,200
so you'll have to wake up early.

309
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,000
I'll get some clothes.

310
00:40:09,640 --> 00:40:10,840
Make yourself at home.

311
00:40:28,680 --> 00:40:30,000
I've put on fresh sheets.

312
00:40:33,680 --> 00:40:35,960
Just relax and stay here.
It's very safe.

313
00:40:36,600 --> 00:40:38,320
If you need anything, just call me.

314
00:40:38,400 --> 00:40:39,440
I'll come right over.

315
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:42,840
It's late. Get some rest.

316
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:47,720
Chen Yanzhou.

317
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:51,880
Stay here tonight.

318
00:41:01,280 --> 00:41:03,280
During the time you were away,

319
00:41:04,560 --> 00:41:05,920
I missed you so much.

320
00:41:09,280 --> 00:41:10,120
I…

321
00:41:11,520 --> 00:41:12,720
missed you too.

322
00:41:20,080 --> 00:41:21,840
Even though I missed you so much,

323
00:41:22,720 --> 00:41:24,400
I kept holding back and never said it.

324
00:41:26,920 --> 00:41:29,640
Chen Yanzhou.
I don't want to hold back anymore.

325
00:41:31,320 --> 00:41:32,440
I…

326
00:42:40,680 --> 00:42:41,920
It's getting late.

327
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:43,880
I'll go get the bed ready for you.

328
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:02,200
You take the bed.

329
00:43:03,400 --> 00:43:04,280
What about you?

330
00:43:04,360 --> 00:43:05,760
The sofa.

331
00:43:09,600 --> 00:43:11,280
Here's a new pillow.

332
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:12,280
Oh right.

333
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:15,360
The bedroom is a little small,
so watch your head.

334
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,440
<i>I'm so annoyed!</i>

335
00:43:27,520 --> 00:43:28,720
<i>What's wrong?</i>

336
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:30,520
<i>I've been binge-watching a drama lately.</i>

337
00:43:30,600 --> 00:43:33,640
<i>It's already absurd that the leads don't</i>
<i>get together until the last two episodes.</i>

338
00:43:33,720 --> 00:43:36,280
<i>At the end of one episode,</i>
<i>the mood was completely right,</i>

339
00:43:36,360 --> 00:43:38,160
<i>yet the male lead stopped mid-kiss!</i>

340
00:43:38,240 --> 00:43:41,440
<i>And then nothing even happened!</i>
<i>That is beyond ridiculous!</i>

341
00:43:41,520 --> 00:43:42,360
<i>Why?</i>

342
00:43:42,440 --> 00:43:43,920
<i>Why else?</i>

343
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:45,680
<i>Because that man is obviously the problem!</i>

344
00:43:45,760 --> 00:43:46,920
Zheng Yu.

345
00:43:56,840 --> 00:43:59,640
Your reaction makes it look like
you've got a guilty conscience.

346
00:44:04,680 --> 00:44:05,880
I brought a nightlight for you.

347
00:44:05,960 --> 00:44:07,680
If you need to use the bathroom at night,

348
00:44:07,760 --> 00:44:09,680
you can turn it on
so you don't bump into anything.

349
00:44:11,280 --> 00:44:14,680
Here's a charging cable for your phone.
In case you left without bringing one.

350
00:44:14,760 --> 00:44:17,600
And one more thing. Here are the keys
to the front door and bedroom.

351
00:44:17,680 --> 00:44:18,760
Keep them.

352
00:44:21,880 --> 00:44:23,280
Bedroom key…

353
00:44:24,680 --> 00:44:26,840
You keep it. I won't go in.

354
00:44:31,800 --> 00:44:32,680
Get some rest.

355
00:45:51,160 --> 00:45:52,520
DORM 223 LET'S GO

356
00:45:52,600 --> 00:45:55,360
<i>Isn't it the middle of the night</i>
<i>in Berlin right now?</i>

357
00:45:55,440 --> 00:45:58,000
<i>Zheng Yu, what are you doing up so late?</i>

358
00:45:58,080 --> 00:45:59,760
<i>She must be sleepwalking.</i>

359
00:45:59,840 --> 00:46:02,360
XU FANGLI: @ZY

360
00:46:03,880 --> 00:46:05,480
<i>I sent it by mistake.</i>

361
00:46:10,960 --> 00:46:13,880
<i>And here I thought</i>
<i>you were really interested in this topic!</i>

362
00:46:37,640 --> 00:46:40,520
<i>Zheng Yu, why did you stop replying?</i>

363
00:46:40,600 --> 00:46:41,560
<i>Zheng Yu?</i>

364
00:46:42,080 --> 00:46:43,400
<i>Be honest.</i>

365
00:46:43,480 --> 00:46:45,520
<i>Did you really just send that by mistake?</i>

366
00:49:11,720 --> 00:49:16,720
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
